            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Kei",
            "review_text": "Thalia_RR\nNew York City, New York35 contributions\n0\nIf your hungry don’t come here\nMar 2019 • Couples\nThis review is for the landmark 81 location. Worst service bad small sized portions for the price you pay.\nI ordered a chicken teriyaki which didn’t come with rice I had to pay extra they literally served me 8 thin small pieces of chicken with some shredded cabbage. Rip off food is tatesleas my partner ordered udon curry it was boiling hot not even edible. It was supposed to have beef and had no veg in it. !!!!!!! The waitress forgot our miso soup and our drinks. Mind you there was only 2 other table in the whole restaurant. Not busy at all and we waited over 30 minutes for our food with no drinks no soup. They finally brought out our food the brought our miso soup which was like warm. Then brought us drinks 10 minutes after our food. If you want to starve and be aggravated come to this place. Staff was nice but whoever trained to needs to be fired. The whole staff needs to be trained desperately. If I could I would give them a zero.\nRead more\nWritten March 14, 2019",
